Packages built by these recipes contain third-party programs under their own
licences (GPL-2.0-or-later: grep, gzip, tar, patch, make; GPL-3.0-or-later OR
BSD-2-Clause: less; Zlib: zlib). Each package ships its upstream licence text
under <prefix>/doc/<tool>/, and each recipe pins the exact upstream source
(URL + sha256) and carries its patches, which together are the corresponding
source of the published binaries.

Built binaries link the startup objects and the shared libc of the stock Amiga
UNIX (Amix) SVR4 system. On 2026-09-23 Amiga Corporation approved the
distribution of the Commodore Amiga binaries that this project builds on.

